    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Important Note:</strong> <i>Wahm is not a demo.</i> This is the <strong>complete game</strong>, designed with a progressive structure \u2014 new levels and features are included through future updates as part of the full experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wahm</strong> is a first-person horror game with a surreal and chaotic style. In this evolving nightmare, you're thrown into unpredictable scenarios where logic collapses and terror takes many forms. Each level offers a unique experience filled with eerie visuals, abstract puzzles, and unsettling sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another horror game \u2014 it's a dive into the uncanny and unknown. Wahm doesn\u2019t follow traditional storytelling; instead, it traps you in shifting environments that distort your sense of safety and reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Psychological and surreal horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Short but intense levels filled with mystery and fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Continuous content updates: new levels and experiences will be added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a Immersive ambient sound and minimal UI for full immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Unique art direction with randomized sequences and outcomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The game is regularly enhanced with additional levels and improvements. These updates are part of the game\u2019s original design \u2014 not a separate demo or test phase.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Important Note:</strong> <i>Wahm is not a demo.</i> This is the <strong>complete game</strong>, designed with a progressive structure \u2014 new levels and features are included through future updates as part of the full experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wahm</strong> is a first-person horror game with a surreal and chaotic style. In this evolving nightmare, you're thrown into unpredictable scenarios where logic collapses and terror takes many forms. Each level offers a unique experience filled with eerie visuals, abstract puzzles, and unsettling sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just another horror game \u2014 it's a dive into the uncanny and unknown. Wahm doesn\u2019t follow traditional storytelling; instead, it traps you in shifting environments that distort your sense of safety and reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Psychological and surreal horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Short but intense levels filled with mystery and fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Continuous content updates: new levels and experiences will be added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a Immersive ambient sound and minimal UI for full immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Unique art direction with randomized sequences and outcomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> The game is regularly enhanced with additional levels and improvements. These updates are part of the game\u2019s original design \u2014 not a separate demo or test phase.</p>",
